{"game":"OpenRA-OpenRA","category":"vfx-blood-finishers","cell":13,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs","licence":"GPL-3.0-or-later (file headers; repo COPYING is GPL v3)","licence_class":"copyleft","target_module":"src/fight/screen-fx.ts","parity_row":10,"pattern_tags":["fixed-step","new:summed-intensity-falloff","new:capped-sum","new:expiry-tick","new:additive-offset-delta","new:fixed-oscillation"],"data_fields":[{"name":"shake_duration_death","donor_constant":"10 ticks (default)","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Mods.Common/Traits/ShakeOnDeath.cs:22"},{"name":"shake_intensity_death","donor_constant":"1 (default)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Mods.Common/Traits/ShakeOnDeath.cs:23"},{"name":"shake_intensity_cap","donor_constant":"10 (summed intensity, min(.., 10))","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:87"},{"name":"shake_intensity_scale","donor_constant":"100 * 1024 * 1024 times intensity / squared distance","unit":"none","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:84"},{"name":"shake_multiplier_min","donor_constant":"-3 per axis (default)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:23"},{"name":"shake_multiplier_max","donor_constant":"3 per axis (default)","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:24"},{"name":"shake_period_x","donor_constant":"4 ticks (sin of tick times 2pi/4)","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:71"},{"name":"shake_period_y","donor_constant":"5 ticks (cos of tick times 2pi/5)","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Game/Traits/World/ScreenShaker.cs:72"},{"name":"shake_warhead_duration_intensity_multiplier","donor_constant":"per warhead YAML, defaults 0","unit":"ticks","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/OpenRA-OpenRA/OpenRA.Mods.Common/Warheads/ShakeScreenWarhead.cs:22"}],"best_idea":"Shake the view by a separate additive offset whose strength is the sum of nearby hits over squared distance, capped, and let each shake expire after a fixed number of ticks, so a many-on-one pile-on cannot shake the view harder than the cap.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"Keep the summed, capped, distance-weighted strength and expiry in ticks; drive it from server-verified hit and kill events; keep the shake a separate offset the camera's own follow never reads or writes; make duration, intensity and cap data. Change the fixed sine/cosine pattern only if hit direction must show.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A hit that lands close to the viewer shakes the view for its few ticks in a fixed pattern, a far hit barely moves it, and any number of simultaneous hits never moves the view more than 30 units per axis."}
